{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11647","headline":"诸将五首 四 · 杜甫","name":"诸将五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回首扶桑铜柱标，冥冥氛祲未全销。\n越裳翡翠无消息，南海明珠久寂寥。\n殊锡曾爲大司马，总戎皆插侍中貂。\n炎风朔雪天王地，只在忠臣翊圣朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}